### 2.4 Deep learning pipeline

A ResNet-18 backbone pretrained on ImageNet was employed as the DL baseline. The network was fine-tuned using the AdamW optimizer with a learning rate of 1×10−41\times 10^{-4}, weight decay of 1×10−41\times 10^{-4}, a batch size of 128, and trained for 3 epochs. The best checkpoint was selected according to the minimum validation loss, and cross-entropy loss was used as the optimization objective.

